    "id": "ba6f3cb1b6678be82750",
    "source": "Record a relationship changing for good, for a reason the relationship rules give, or 'breakup' or 'betrayal' when a romance ends badly; every reason but 'parting' closes the book. A 'parting' is also for the ally who stays behind while the party travels on. Call it BEFORE narrating the goodbye.",
